  "description": "A full-featured code and text editor control for your app, with the kind of editing experience you'd expect from a professional IDE. It includes syntax highlighting, code folding, a completion popup, search, line numbers, and undo/redo, and stays responsive even on very large documents. Text is rendered with the same shaping and layout engine used throughout the toolkit, so it always matches the rest of your UI.",
